{"id": "19-2028-2-7", "zh": "67. 在 han 之后作 cha、khā", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2029-2-9", "zh": "在 han 之后，ssa 可以变为 cha 或 khā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2029-10-12", "zh": "例如 paṭihaṃkhāmi、paṭihanissāmi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2029-13-15", "zh": "haṃchema、hanissāma。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2029-16-21", "zh": "ahani、ahaniṃsu 等，各处都应照此配置。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2029-22-22", "zh": "hu 类词根", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2030-2-6", "zh": "hu：表示献供。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2030-7-9", "zh": "在 ti 等词尾前加词根后缀（vikaraṇa）la。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2030-10-49", "zh": "依“parokkhāyañca”一条中的 ca 字，hu 重叠为 hu hu；依“kavaggahānaṃ cavaggajā”，h 变为 j；la 脱落，并作元音强化（vuddhi），得 juhoti aggiṃ（他向火献供）；不作强化时，依“yavā sare”变为 v，得 juhvati。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2030-50-51", "zh": "juhonti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2030-52-53", "zh": "juhvanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2030-54-59", "zh": "juhosi、juhvasi；juhotha、juhvatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2030-60-61", "zh": "等等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2030-62-63", "zh": "被动语态中：", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2030-64-76", "zh": "依“dīgho sarassa”，元音变长，得 hūyati tena aggi（火被他献供）等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2030-77-80", "zh": "juhissati、juhissanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2030-81-88", "zh": "ajuhavi、ajuhosi；ajuhavuṃ、ajuhaviṃsu、ajuhavaṃsu、ajuhosuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2030-89-92", "zh": "ajuhissa、ajuhissaṃsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2030-93-95", "zh": "juhe、juheyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2030-96-100", "zh": "juhotu、juhontu 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2031-2-19", "zh": "hā：表示舍弃。与前面一样，作重叠、替换并使 la 脱落之后，依“rasso pubbassa”，前一个 ā 变短。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-2031-20-22", "zh": "得 jahāti 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2031-23-24", "zh": "被动语态中：", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2031-25-40", "zh": "依“aññādissāssī kye”，在 kya 前 ā 变为 ī，得 hīyati 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2031-41-42", "zh": "jahissati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2031-43-61", "zh": "ajahāsi，依“dīghā īssa”加 si；pajahi；ajahiṃsu、ajahaṃsu；pajahiṃsu、pajahuṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2031-62-64", "zh": "被动语态中：pahīyi、pahīyittha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2031-65-71", "zh": "ssati 等、eyya 等、tu 等词尾中的形式，也应依此类推得知。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2032-2-14", "zh": "dā：表示布施。作重叠并变短，la 脱落，得 dadāti、dadanti 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2032-15-26", "zh": "依“gamavadā…”等规则替换为 dajja，得 dajjati、dajjanti 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2032-27-33", "zh": "la 变为 e 时，得 dānaṃ deti（布施）等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2033-2-9", "zh": "22. 未重叠时，dā 在 mi、ma 前可以变为 daṃ", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2034-2-9", "zh": "未经重叠的 dā，在 mi、ma 前可以变为 daṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2034-10-17", "zh": "ṃ 变为同组鼻音：dammi、demi；damma、dema。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2034-18-21", "zh": "变为 ī 时，得 dīyati 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2034-22-29", "zh": "表示未来时，加入 i 音，并作元音脱落等，得 dadissati、dadissanti。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-2034-30-33", "zh": "dajjissati、dajjissanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2034-34-39", "zh": "在 la 词根后缀的情况下，得 dassati、dassanti。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-2034-40-51", "zh": "近过去时（ajjatanī）中：adadi、adadiṃsu、adajji、adajjiṃsu、adāsi、adaṃsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2034-52-55", "zh": "远过去时中：adadā、adadu。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2034-56-63", "zh": "条件时（kālātipatti）中：adadissa、adajjissa；带 la 时，adassa、dassaṃsu。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-2034-64-68", "zh": "eyya 等词尾中：dade、dadeyya、dajje、dajjeyya。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2034-69-86", "zh": "依“ṭā”一条，由于“多种适用”（bahula）的统辖，在替换成的 dajja 之后，后面的 eyya 变为 ṭā，得 dajjā；又有 dajjuṃ、dajjeyyaṃ、dadeyyuṃ。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-2034-87-102", "zh": "tu 等词尾中：dadātu、dadantu、dajjatu、dajjantu；la 变为 e 时，得 detu、dentu 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2034-103-106", "zh": "各处的被动语态也应照此配置。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2035-2-26", "zh": "dhā：表示持有。在 ti 等词尾前，依规则中的 ca 字作重叠，前一个 ā 变短，la 脱落，并依“catutthadutiyānaṃ tatiyapaṭhamā”把前一个 dh 变为 d，得 dadhāti、dadhanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2035-27-54", "zh": "带前缀 pi 时，依“tadaminā…”等规则，a 脱落；依“dhāssa ho”，重叠后，后一个 dhā 变为 h，得 dvāraṃ pidahati（关上门）、pidahanti。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-2035-55-61", "zh": "la 变为 e 时，得 nidheti、nidhenti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2035-62-66", "zh": "被动语态中：vidhīyati、vidhīyanti 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-2035-67-72", "zh": "dhassati、pidahissati、paridahessati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2035-73-76", "zh": "adhāsi、pidahi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2035-77-80", "zh": "adhassa、pidahissa。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2035-81-86", "zh": "dadhe、dadheyya；pidahe、pidaheyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-2035-87-99", "zh": "dadātu、pidahatu、nidhetu、nidhentu 等。（以上是 juhoti 类。）", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2036-2-11", "zh": "bhū 类、juha 类，以及这些 hu 类的词根，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-2037-2-8", "zh": "连同带元音强化的 bhū 类，分为三种。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-2038-2-5", "zh": "（以上是 bhū 类的方法。）", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2039-2-10", "zh": "现在，为了说明词根后缀的区别，举出 rudh 等八类词根的一些词形：", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-2040-2-8", "zh": "rudha：表示遮蔽。其后接 ti 等词尾。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-2040-9-13", "zh": "以下各类也都是这样。", "confidence": 70}
